{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18036","headline":"送李翺 · 韩愈","name":"送李翺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"广州万里途，山重江逶迤。\n行行何时到，谁能定归期。\n揖我出门去，颜色异恒时。\n虽云有追送，足迹绝自兹。\n人生一世间，不自张与弛。\n譬如浮江木，纵横岂自知。\n宁怀别时苦，勿作别後思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18036.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18036","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}